%%{init: {'theme': 'base'}}%%

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client / Agent
    participant A as API Pod
    participant RD as Redis Cache
    participant EMB as Embedding (LRU + provider)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    C->>A: POST /api/v1/search<br/>Bearer JWT + query
    A->>A: jwtVerify → claims overwrite body identity
    A->>A: rate limit by userId
    A->>RD: GET cache:<org>:<user>:<sha256(req+ACL)>

    alt Cache hit (p95 ~13ms)
        RD-->>A: cached response
        A-->>C: 200 + results
    else Cache miss
        A->>A: Extract query entities
        A->>EMB: embed(query) — LRU first, then provider

        par Three signals on separate pooled connections
            A->>PG: pgvector HNSW ANN (top 50)<br/>SET LOCAL app.* → RLS
            A->>PG: FTS ts_rank + pg_trgm (top 50)<br/>SET LOCAL app.* → RLS
            A->>PG: memory_facts by entity overlap<br/>SET LOCAL app.* → RLS
        end

        A->>PG: Batched hydration<br/>WHERE id = ANY(...)<br/>omits embedding column

        A->>A: Temporal scoring (metadata)

        opt top semantic < 0.85 + repo context
            A->>PG: Recursive graph expansion
            A->>PG: Batched hydration
        end

        A->>A: RRF fusion → Map
        A->>A: ACL filter (second layer behind RLS)
        A->>A: Composite ranking + top-K
        A->>RD: SETEX response (1h TTL)
        A->>RD: ZINCRBY popular query
        A-->>C: 200 + results (p95 ~113ms @ c=16)
    end
